<title>FRANCE: Morocco millers buy 25,000 T Canadian durum - trade.</title>
<headline>Morocco millers buy 25,000 T Canadian durum - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan millers group Comite Professionnel de la Minoterie bought 25,000 tonnes of Canadian durum wheat at $218 per tonne, cost and freight, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Millers made the purchase at a November 1 tender, they said.</p>
<p>The wheat is for delivery between November 25 and November 30.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
